        <mxCell id="uSw7vNQwVvC0cYuDEnIb-9" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(236, 236, 236); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;Application integrates with Amazon Bedrock and Nova Act for AI-powered order automation. AgentCore Browser Tool provides secure, isolated browser environment for web automation. Main Agent orchestrates Nova Act Agent and Strands + Playwright Agent for intelligent browser control.&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
